458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 314 0 R
/E (The use of AI, specifically Gemini 1.5 Pro, was explored across various facets of project development, such as research, ideation, strategy, and editing. In research, AI aided in gathering local e-commerce data, though manual checks were necessary for local nuances. Future protocols suggest initial manual audits for a clearer baseline before AI use. In ideation, AI effectively structured persona matrices and technical requirements, but future strategies could benefit from early critical simulations. Core business strategies were crafted without AI to maintain authenticity, underscoring the importance of preserving unique project elements. Finally, AI served as a final editorial tool, enhancing document clarity and consistency, with a recommendation for early-stage multi-perspective reviews to improve technical precision.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
